# HybriMoE — ODS integration analysis

## Executive summary

HybriMoE explores hybrid CPU/GPU execution for MoE inference, combining dynamic scheduling, prefetching and cache management for limited accelerator memory.

**ODS classification: P1/P2 — runtime/capability research.**

## ODS fit

The project is particularly relevant to the execution-strategy layer because it can decide where work or experts should reside according to available resources.

It should be studied as a composable capability rather than automatically adopted as a complete backend.